; Swing Trade Tracker - MT5 Strategy Tester inputs
;
; Load in the Strategy Tester "Inputs" tab -> Load, then set the tester to
; Optimization = "Slow complete algorithm" and run. InpStrategy is flagged
; for optimization with start=0 step=1 stop=6, so MT5 makes seven passes -
; one per strategy - and the Optimization Results tab becomes the
; strategy-comparison table (sort by Profit Factor or Expected Payoff).
;
; To backtest a SINGLE strategy instead, set the optimize flag on the
; InpStrategy line below from Y to N and pick the value you want:
;   0 RSI(2) Mean Reversion   1 Double 7s        2 Bollinger Snapback
;   3 SMA20 Trend Pullback    4 20-Day Breakout  5 MACD Trend Cross
;   6 Bear CRWV Pullback Score
;
; Symbols must match YOUR broker's naming. Many brokers suffix stock CFDs
; (AAPL.US, AAPL.NAS, #AAPL). Edit InpSymbolList to match, or leave it
; empty to test only the chart symbol.
;
; Format: name=value||start||step||stop||optimize(Y/N)

InpStrategy=0||0||1||6||Y
InpBearMinScore=45||45||5||45||N
InpSymbolList=AAPL,MSFT,NVDA,AMZN,GOOGL,META,TSLA,AMD,AVGO,JPM,V,UNH,HD,COST,LLY,XOM,PG,KO,PEP,CRM
InpRiskPercent=1.0||1.0||1.0||1.0||N
InpFixedLots=1.0||1.0||1.0||1.0||N
InpMinPrice=5.0||5.0||1.0||5.0||N
InpMinAvgVolume=500000.0||500000.0||100000.0||500000.0||N
InpHistoryBars=400||400||10||400||N
InpMagic=20260713||20260713||1||20260713||N
InpSlippage=20||20||1||20||N
